oud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t7":{"id":"t7","x":0,"y":169,"text":"• I = C - H/2 + N/2 - X/2 + 1; O telt niet mee.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t8":{"id":"t8","x":0,"y":188,"text":"• DBE 4 of meer: denk aan een benzeenring.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t9":{"id":"t9","x":0,"y":207,"text":"• Werk altijd in dezelfde volgorde: formule, DBE, ¹³C, ¹H, structuur, controle.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t10":{"id":"t10","x":0,"y":268,"text":"2. ¹H-NMR aflezen: ppm, integraal en opsplitsing","bold":true,"size":19,"color":"#1d4ed8"},"t11":{"id":"t11","x":0,"y":296,"text":"Het ¹H-spectrum geeft per signaal drie stukjes informatie. Het lesdoel noemt ze letterlijk: de chemische","size":13,"italic":true},"t12":{"id":"t12","x":0,"y":315,"text":"verschuiving, de multipliciteit en de integraalverhouding. Samen vertellen ze welke H er zijn en wie","size":13,"italic":true},"t13":{"id":"t13","x":0,"y":334,"text":"naast wie zit.","size":13,"italic":true},"t14":{"id":"t14","x":0,"y":363,"text":"Onthoud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t15":{"id":"t15","x":0,"y":382,"text":"• ppm: welke omgeving. Integraal: hoeveel H. Opsplitsing: hoeveel buren (n+1).","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t16":{"id":"t16","x":0,"y":401,"text":"• Brede singlet van 1H of 2H: denk aan OH of NH₂.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t17":{"id":"t17","x":0,"y":420,"text":"• Singlet betekent: geen H op het buur-C.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t18":{"id":"t18","x":0,"y":481,"text":"3. ¹³C-NMR en APT: aantal C, symmetrie en type C","bold":true,"size":19,"color":"#1d4ed8"},"t19":{"id":"t19","x":0,"y":509,"text":"Het lesdoel vraagt dat je uit een ¹³C-spectrum haalt hoeveel C-atomen er zijn, hoe symmetrisch het","size":13,"italic":true},"t20":{"id":"t20","x":0,"y":528,"text":"molecuul is en hoeveel H er op elk C zit. In de dia's is daarvoor een APT-spectrum gebruikt.","size":13,"italic":true},"t21":{"id":"t21","x":0,"y":557,"text":"Onthoud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t22":{"id":"